		{
			dependencies: [
				"538878174A36026A"
				"14D8D8D9D6CB0A21"
			]
			description: [
				"EMC Links are blocks that you can import/send items to and it will convert them to EMC. The lowest tier is \"Basic\", which can only import 1 item per second. The higher tiers have much higher limits, so we'd recommend you keep upgrading as you can. These also have EMC so you don't have to continually craft up through the tiers."
				""
				"EMC Links can also export items (and liquids!) using EMC. Exports are also limited by the items (or mB) per second metric. To configure the export, place the EMC link down, hold the item in your hand you want to export, and right-click. For liquids, hold a bucket of the liquid in your hand instead; note that not all liquids have EMC values."
			]
			id: "35A3086F9A7AE170"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3391029F069C29CA"
				item: "projectexpansion:basic_emc_link"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -4.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
