				"1EDC6445A37B1ABB"
			]
			description: ["Alchemical Chests are *very* large chests, but they're also needed for the first tier of the EMC Link. They also don't cost a ton of EMC, so it's not a bad idea to use these next to a Tinker's Crafting Station for easier crafting."]
			id: "14D8D8D9D6CB0A21"
